           Extensions (MIME) 
           Part One: Format 
           of Internet 
           Message Bodies
         - RFC 2068 Hypertext 
           Transfer Protocol 
           -- HTTP/1.1
         - RFC 2617 HTTP 
           Authentication: 
           Basic and Digest 
           Access Authentication

